  "notable_quotes": [
    "MOFs such as MOF-5, MOF-74, ZIF-68 and UiO-66 generally require high temperature or pressure because they lack effective epoxide and CO2 activation sites.",
    "The paper proposes a design rule that porous MOFs combining HBD groups, N-rich units and micropores should be effective for mild CO2 conversion.",
    "Zn(dobdc)(datz) was versatile for different epoxides and could be recycled for six runs with no loss of catalytic performance."
